<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:45.040
Tails, we should take a break.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.710
Yeah, but the security system went offline for a moment.

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.540
I'm worried about it.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:52.750
Do you need any help?

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.170
I can take care of it myself.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.180
There are no enemies in our safety perimeter.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.720
You should rest while you can.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.680
This won't last long.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.100
Probably.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.300
Okay, I'll restart the security system.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.060
An intruder!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.270
Area A-12!

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.850
Cosmo's room!

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:02.340
Episode 73

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:02.340
Shadow the Assassin!

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.700
Die.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.000
Cosmo!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.000
Shadow?

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.180
Wait, Shadow.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.730
You better have a good explanation for this.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.870
Sonic!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:50.080
Tails, grab Cosmo and run away!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.550
What's going on, Cosmo?

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:10.770
Shadow tried to kill me.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:51.520
What's going on? Someone, answer me!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.810
There's big trouble! Sonic and Chris!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.400
Shadow attacked them, and they're badly hurt!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.770
Why?

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.070
We don't know, but...

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.860
Shadow also attacked Cosmo.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.490
So he's our enemy?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.580
It doesn't matter if he's friend or foe!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.200
Just go and rescue the two!

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.870
Understand?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.290
Leave it to me!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.130
It's dangerous, so you stay put!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.850
Accessing Blue Typhoon's computer.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.770
Breaking into heat source search program.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.230
What are you doing?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.780
He broke in during the short time that I was performing a security check.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.530
Just in case, I'm blocking the heat source search.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.160
Okay!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.790
All that's left to do is...

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.580
Blocking surveillance camera access.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.000
Oh no! He found us!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.890
This way!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.660
Shadow, I'm fighting you!

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.090
Why did Shadow attack me?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:57.850
Maybe Eggman ordered him. Or the Metarex could be controlling him.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.270
Metarex?

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:03.270
But that's not the issue.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:08.490
The only thing we know for sure is that someone wants to kill you.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.110
That's why I'll...

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.710
I'll protect you!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.290
Tails...

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.350
Wait!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.120
Let's take the X-Tornado and get away from the ship for now.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.040
Ready for takeoff! Catapult on!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.470
We're fine now.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:33.240
Hand her over. I have no intention of killing you.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:36.200
Why are you trying to kill Cosmo?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.330
Are the Metarex controlling you?

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.700
Knowing why won't change anything.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.290
Get out of my way or die.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.000
I won't let you! I'll protect Cosmo!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.380
But you can't.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.030
Bat girl!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.660
It's been awhile.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:21.830
You're helping Shadow?

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.080
Correct. That's pretty sharp for you.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.750
Why are you doing this?

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.170
I figured that you guys would think of a solution.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.420
But hardheaded folk like you are dime a dozen.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:40.220
This isn't the time to be sarcastic! Can't you contact him?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.140
It's not that I can't...

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.520
Then hurry up! Both their lives are at stake!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.650
Fine!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.400
Can you hear me? Shadow, it's me.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.650
Can you hear me, Shadow?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.240
Shadow? What's the matter?

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.660
Shadow, answer me!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.830
Shadow?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.330
It's no good. I can't reach him.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.500
Tails... Cosmo...

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:17.260
I swore to protect Cosmo!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.510
Do you think you have the power to do that?

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.720
I don't know until I try!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.290
There's a fire in the hangar!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.370
Tails, hang in there...

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.820
Intruder detected. Eliminate.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.740
He's coming!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.750
Don't worry! Trust me!

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.360
We're almost there!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.590
This way!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.180
Knuckles!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:34.520
Leave him to me!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.860
Don't you dare underestimate me!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.660
Hurry and get out of here!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.080
Thank you, Knuckles!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.420
I'll punish anyone who gets in my way.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:59.210
You can brag if you defeat me!

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.590
I'll do that.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.390
What?

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.730
That echidna gave it his all.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.860
He forced you to take off your limiters.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.790
You're still not giving up?

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.770
This way!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.650
Tails, it's a dead end!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.160
We're finished.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:18.670
At least tell me who ordered you to kill me!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.330
No one.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.720
I'm doing this on my own.

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:40.480
We don't want any more innocent victims, do we?

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.730
Why do you want to kill me?

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:46.280
It's better for you if you die without knowing.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.700
I won't let you do this!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.200
Buying time isn't going to change anything.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.870
I'm not buying time.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.840
Do you actually think this will stop me?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.030
I can handle this!

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:43.790
Turning off retrieval function! Firing Sonic Driver immediately!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.060
We were lucky.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:07.400
If Shadow didn't try to break out by spinning, it wouldn't have worked.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.530
Let's go.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:16.990
That was...

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.160
Tails, you did it.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.460
What about Shadow?

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.080
I'm sure he's still alive.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.250
But he won't be back for awhile.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:29.050
But more importantly...

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.920
Tell me what's going on!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.970
Don't look at me like that.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.220
Here.

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:43.480
That's where it all began.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.730
This world is dead.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.360
What?

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:59.200
He's a member of the resistance.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.710
What happened?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:08.840
This is what it means to survive...

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:17.010
This is tranquility and order...

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:21.220
You become a part of them...

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.140
Shadow...

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:30.070
My left pocket...

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.780
What's this?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:39.740
Stop them...

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:55.300
We saw the same thing on other planets.

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:02.390
This is the world of the Metarex.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.520
This world doesn't feel right.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:10.440
You have no memories. What kind of world is right for you?

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.820
I don't know, but...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.320
I don't think that this world is right.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.910
What does that have to do with killing Cosmo?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.290
All the secrets are in here.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.170
What you do going forward is up to you.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.940
Tails, I...

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.860
You don't need to say anything for now.

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:55.280
Let's start up the Blue Typhoon and leave.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.880
It was a fake.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.340
Run for it, Cosmo!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.260
Tails!

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.690
Tails!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.620
Close your eyes.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:06.970
I'm going to protect Cosmo!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:10.620
Good work, White Seed.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:14.210
You accomplished your mission.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:18.000
Mission? White Seed?

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:22.380
White Seed...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.980
I don't want to die...

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:46.110
I don't want to die yet!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:57.250
Then listen to my voice! Take my hand!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.040
I don't want to die yet...

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:10.810
Take my hand and listen to my voice.

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:17.900
Your eyes are mine. Your ears are mine.

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:25.440
No!

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:54.020
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:54.020
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:54.020
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

